  "help": "<p class=\"infomark\"><strong>What it does</strong></p>\n<p>This tool creates a text file with recurring lines. You can specify a bunch of characters or entire sentences.\nThe entire string will be printed X times separated by a line break. X can be either given by the use as a number or calculated by a given file.\nIn case the user provides a file, the line number will be used as X.</p>\n",
